@startuml
title P1 Windows UI/data integration

actor User
component "Win32 main window\nand tray" as UI
component "WindowsIdentityComposition" as Identity
component "WindowsPhaseOneComposition" as Phase
component "WindowsCaptureWorkflowController" as Capture
component "WindowsOnboardingService" as Onboarding
component "DPAPI credential repository" as DPAPI
component "RecoveryExporter" as Recovery
component "PhaseOneDraftOutbox" as Outbox
component "PhaseOneAppClient" as Client
database "capture-media/drafts" as Drafts
database "draft-outbox-v1.json" as Metadata
cloud "Barycenter coordinator" as Coordinator

User --> UI
UI --> Identity : Create / Join / Save recovery
Identity --> Onboarding
Onboarding --> DPAPI
Identity --> Recovery : explicit selected path
UI --> Phase : route / delivery / send / history action
UI --> Capture : record / choose outgoing file
Capture --> Outbox : finalized user draft only
Capture --> Drafts
Phase --> Outbox
Outbox --> Metadata : fsync + atomic rename
Outbox --> Drafts : confirmed cleanup / explicit delete
Outbox --> Client
Phase --> Client : presence / history / policy actions
Client --> Coordinator : active origin-bound bearer

note bottom of Capture
Microphone and picked-file drafts share
the durable user-recording boundary.
Self-test remains local/disposable and
never reaches Outbox.
end note
@enduml
